thor) ... preserving REBAR_ENV_ID-set-but-empty->error`"],"finding":"The plan's single `resolve_event_identity(cfg)` asserts it preserves 'REBAR_ENV_ID-set-but-empty->error', but the codebase has THREE distinct current REBAR_ENV_ID read behaviors that a single resolver cannot uniformly reproduce: last_pass.resolve_environment_id (L71-75) RAISES LastPassError on set-but-empty; last_pass L329 passes `os.environ.get('REBAR_ENV_ID')` raw with NO error; inbound_translate L174 `_rebar_env('ENV_ID', LEGACY_JIRA_ENV_ID)` returns the default only when UNSET (empty string -> '' , never raises). The set-but-empty->error property is true ONLY of last_pass L71.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f778a40c181b4430a","impact":1.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"The cut, by cluster -> 'Owned config.py resolvers': resolve_event_identity(cfg); identity/tuning bullet","norm_id":"n8bb05e2c6630bdfe","priority":0.9,"reason":"high-priority+criterion-opted-in","recalled":false,"scenarios":["An operator sets REBAR_ENV_ID='' expecting the inbound_translate path to fall back to LEGACY_JIRA_ENV_ID as it does today; after the cut the unified resolver raises instead, changing provider-neutral outcome.","Or the resolver is made non-raising to match inbound_translate, silently dropping the last_pass L71 fail-loud guard."],"severity":"critical","suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":0.9,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"yes","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"na","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"yes","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"yes","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"module","deb